i wake up at 7Am in morning, when i open my eyes i think about my day,
i usually take deep breath sit for while, first i go to bathroom for brush.
i usually take cold water to wash my face, cold water gives me freshness & enery in morning,
some times i take worm water.
after dry off i wear clean cloaths,
if i have meeting in morning is  i usually wear more formals.
in breakfast i eat chai & chapati or bread, some times i eat omlet with bornveeta,
if i am in hurry for my office i just take tea.
i put my water bottle & tiffint in to bag, 
wear my sheoes & say good bye to my mom.
if i want to go to college i take bus or walk.
or i take my ola.
it takes 45min to reach office.
after arriving office i greet everyone in morning.
switch on my desktop & read all eamils & replay urgent ones.
i just open my calander & plan my day.
create a to do list for day 
ask my namaer whatis task for today.
